  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e08-scene-15",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "君と一緒に新しい時代を作る  (I Will Build a New Era With You)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kuroki": "黒木",
    "muranishi": "村西"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "On a quiet winter holiday evening, Muranishi and Kuroki share cake, admit they have both been waiting to film together again, and resolve to step into the spotlight without hiding anything.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "願い事は何にしますか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "君とまた一緒に作品を作りたい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "やっと言ってくれた。私も同じです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "あの作品を超えるのはそう簡単じゃありません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "でも監督と一緒なら世の中を変えていけるような気がするんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺は誰もやってないことをやりたい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "みんな監督がどんな人なのか知りたがってますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "隠すんですか？モザイクみたいに。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺がどれだけモザイクが嫌いか知ってるか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "ありのままが一番ですよね？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうだ、俺はもう何も失うものはない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ありがとう、やるべきことが見えた。君と一緒に新しい時代を作る。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "願い事は何にしますか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you going to wish for?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "君とまた一緒に作品を作りたい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want to make another film together with you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "やっと言ってくれた。私も同じです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You finally said it. I feel the exact same way.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "あの作品を超えるのはそう簡単じゃありません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Surpassing that debut film of ours won't be easy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "でも監督と一緒なら世の中を変えていけるような気がするんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet with you, I feel as though we can change the world.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺は誰もやってないことをやりたい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want to do something nobody else has ever done.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "みんな監督がどんな人なのか知りたがってますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone out there is eager to know what kind of person you are.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "隠すんですか？モザイクみたいに。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you going to hide yourself—just like censorship?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺がどれだけモザイクが嫌いか知ってるか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you have any idea how much I despise censorship?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "ありのままが一番ですよね？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Showing yourself just as you are is best, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうだ、俺はもう何も失うものはない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That's right, I have nothing left to lose anymore.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ありがとう、やるべきことが見えた。君と一緒に新しい時代を作る。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you, now I see what to do. Together with you, I will build a new era.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "願い事は何にしますか？",
      "gap": 0.5
